<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Digital Heritage | Archive</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/uikit.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body class="uk-light">

    <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="uk-text-center" uk-scrollspy="cls: uk-animation-slide-bottom; delay: 300">
            <h1 class="uk-heading-medium">The Digital Afterlife</h1>
            
            <div class="uk-margin-small-top">
                <a href="/about" class="archive-tag" style="text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;">
                    [ SYSTEM_DOCUMENTATION ]
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="scroll-indicator uk-position-bottom-center uk-margin-medium-bottom">
            <span uk-icon="icon: chevron-down; ratio: 1.5" style="color: var(--accent-blue);"></span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="archive-section">
        <div class="uk-container uk-container-small">
            <div class="archive-content-card" uk-scrollspy="cls: uk-animation-slide-left-small; delay: 300">
                <div class="archive-tag">ARCHIVE_RECORD // 001</div>
                <h3 class="archive-title">The Great Digital Drift</h3>
                <div class="archive-main-text">
                    <p>Millions of digital identities are currently suspended in the cloud—untouched, unmanaged, and slowly becoming digital fossils.</p>
                </div>
                <p class="archive-footer-note">
                    // We are the first generation to leave behind a permanent digital shadow. 
                    <br>
                    // The question is: who will inhabit it when we are gone?
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="archive-section">
        <div class="uk-container uk-container-small">
            <div class="archive-content-card" uk-scrollspy="cls: uk-animation-slide-left-small; delay: 300">
                <div class="archive-tag">SYSTEM_READY // INITIALIZE_SCAN</div>
                <h2 class="archive-title">Ready to assess your legacy?</h2>
                <div class="archive-main-text">
                    <p>The analysis takes approximately 5 minutes. Your data will be processed through our heritage algorithms.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="uk-margin-medium-top">
                    <a href="/quiz" class="uk-button uk-button-primary uk-button-large">
                        > START_ANALYSIS_
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <script src="/js/uikit.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/uikit-icons.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>